                  "explanation": "MDS 3.0 (Minimum Data Set) is the comprehensive assessment tool used in Skilled Nursing Facilities. It drives the PDPM (Patient-Driven Payment Model) reimbursement system. The most tempting wrong answer is OASIS-E, which is the home health assessment (drives PDGM, not PDPM). IRF-PAI is for inpatient rehab (drives CMG). UHDDS is for acute inpatient hospitals. The key is matching: SNF = MDS = PDPM. Tests Domain 1 subtask 1.6 (manage secondary data sources). Difficulty: Knowledge level.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"28\">Data Set Matching</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"160\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">SNF = MDS 3.0 = PDPM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Minimum Data Set is the SNF assessment tool</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Drives Patient-Driven Payment Model reimbursement</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Completed: admission, quarterly, annually, significant change</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"380\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">DO NOT CONFUSE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">OASIS-E = Home health = PDGM | IRF-PAI = Inpatient rehab = CMG</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "SNF uses MDS 3.0 which drives PDPM"
                  }
