                  "explanation": "Psychotherapy notes have SPECIAL protection under HIPAA. They are excluded from the patient's right of access under 45 CFR 164.524. The provider MAY (but is not required to) deny access to psychotherapy notes, and this denial is NOT subject to the review process that applies to other access denials. Option A is the biggest trap -- the right of access specifically EXCLUDES psychotherapy notes. Option C confuses authorization requirements (needed for disclosures TO others) with the right of access (patient's own records). Domain 2/5 cross-domain. Difficulty: Application.",
